From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] uiautomationcore: grid item, item container, traversal options, UiaGetErrorDescription (3568)

uiautomationcore: grid item and item container pattern calls, traversal options, UiaGetErrorDescription

GridPattern_GetItem and ItemContainerPattern_FindItemByProperty are pattern calls like the others: the
element a provider returns comes back as a node. The start element of FindItemByProperty is handed to the
provider as its own provider when it is one of this side, else as a stand-in that answers properties and
the runtime id from the node (a node that came back from another apartment cannot be turned back).
IUIAutomationElement9::Find{First,All}WithOptions[BuildCache] take TreeTraversalOptions: last to first
walks the children from the last, post order is the reverse of the pre-order walk with the children the
other way round (so both together are the reverse of the default order); unknown option bits are
E_INVALIDARG and a NULL result pointer E_POINTER. UiaGetErrorDescription returns the description of the
thread's COM error object. IClassFactory::LockServer is quiet.
---
